{
  "uid": "cloudwatch-elasticache",
  "title": "CloudWatch - ElastiCache (Valkey)",
  "description": "ElastiCache Valkey replication group metrics from CloudWatch (AWS/ElastiCache) - CPU, memory, cache hit/miss ratio, connections, network, and evictions. Single-node replication group (num_cache_clusters = 1), so no replication lag metrics apply. Complements the app-level Redis/Valkey health gauge (django-prometheus) with instance-level visibility.",
